OL,5,G0500 Fletchers' Family Farm
OL,6,     FIt is a busy time on the farm as
OL,7,     Fthe family prepares pigs for the
OL,8,     Fbutcher, ready to become sausages
OL,9,     Ffor their stall at the Royal
OL,10,     FCheshire Show. Liz's plans are
OL,11,     Finterrupted when she discovers an
OL,12,     Finjured hen and takes the bird to
OL,13,     Fher friend Debbie, a chicken
OL,14,     Fexpert. With Liz away, Kelvin
OL,15,     Fenjoys a day with the boys, who
OL,16,     Fget stuck into farm life as they
OL,17,     Fhelp feed the pigs and build a new
OL,18,     Fchicken coop, but there's a bigger
OL,19,     Fproblem in the front field, where
OL,20,     Fflooding has put planting on hold
